TITLE Calcite precipitation with specified gas partial pressures (via equilibrium phases)
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 0.05
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
    Gypsum 0 0
    Aragonite 0 0
    CO2(g) 0 0
    CH4(g) 0 0
    H2S(g) 0 0
REACTION 1
    CO2 1
    CH4 1
    H2S 1
    1
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Calcite_delta
10 PUNCH EQUI_DELTA("Calcite")
END
